{
  "total_duration": 577.339,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.84,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果有个同学总是要跟着你，你会怎么办？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 3.19,
      "end": 8.974,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他不一定是坏人，也许只是太热情、太"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "persistent"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 9.324,
      "end": 16.156,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是当你需要自己的时间，别人还一直"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "insist on coming with you"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，这就变成了打扰。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 16.505,
      "end": 20.465,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Elizabeth 想躲开 Nigel，可 Nigel 偏偏看见了她。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 20.815,
      "end": 26.663,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们学一个很实用的话题："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "how to be polite, and still say no"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 27.013,
      "end": 30.173,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看 Elizabeth 的第一反应。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 30.523,
      "end": 35.763,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Elizabeth 看见 Nigel，立刻穿过马路想避开他。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 36.113,
      "end": 40.125,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I crossed the street to avoid meeting him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 40.475,
      "end": 45.786,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Avoid meeting him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是不小心错过，而是主动避开见面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 46.136,
      "end": 51.536,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是 Nigel 已经看见她了，而且"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "came running towards me"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 51.886,
      "end": 58.886,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "crossed the street, to avoid meeting him, he saw me, came running towards me"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 59.236,
      "end": 62.516,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，假装没看见已经来不及了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 62.866,
      "end": 68.146,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：她再装作没看见已经没用了，只好向他招手。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 68.496,
      "end": 72.964,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It was no use pretending that I had not seen him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 73.314,
      "end": 81.489,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "pretending"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是装作；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It was no use"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "表示这招已经没用了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 81.839,
      "end": 88.215,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以她只能"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "waved to him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，礼貌地打招呼，但心里并不轻松。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 88.565,
      "end": 96.125,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "no use pretending, had not seen him, waved to him, never enjoy meeting Nigel"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 96.475,
      "end": 100.195,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，Nigel 的 persistent 性格出现了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 100.544,
      "end": 105.704,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Nigel 总是没事做，不管别人多忙，他都坚持要跟着。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 106.054,
      "end": 111.674,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "No matter how busy you are, he always insists on coming with you"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 112.024,
      "end": 117.976,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Elizabeth 必须想办法："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "preventing him from following me around all morning"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 118.326,
      "end": 123.558,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Nigel 表面上很客气，问："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Would you mind my coming with you?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 123.908,
      "end": 129.868,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但问题是，他在 Elizabeth 还没说完之前就问了，所以礼貌句子也变成了压力。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 130.218,
      "end": 133.938,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，牙医借口失败，笑点落地。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 134.287,
      "end": 141.087,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：她说要去看牙医，没想到 Nigel 还要跟去，因为候诊室有东西可读。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 141.437,
      "end": 145.061,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Elizabeth 说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I'm going to the dentist"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 145.411,
      "end": 150.811,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "她以为 dentist visit 很私人，也不有趣，可以让 Nigel 放弃。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 151.161,
      "end": 158.641,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可 Nigel 回答："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Then I'll come with you"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，还说候诊室里"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "plenty to read"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 158.991,
      "end": 164.991,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住：persistent 在这里不是邪恶，而是太不会看边界。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 165.34,
      "end": 169.794,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "persistent"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是不是一个坏词？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 170.144,
      "end": 176.824,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不一定。你坚持练琴、坚持背单词、坚持训练，这种 persistence 是优点。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 177.174,
      "end": 180.097,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那 Nigel 为什么让人不舒服？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 180.447,
      "end": 187.367,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为他把坚持用在别人身上。别人需要空间，他还一直 insist，这就越过了 boundary。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 187.717,
      "end": 190.457,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Elizabeth 为什么不直接说 no？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 190.807,
      "end": 199.407,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "很多人怕显得不礼貌，所以会绕弯、找借口。可是太不清楚的礼貌，有时会让局面更尴尬。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 199.757,
      "end": 205.165,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Would you mind my coming with you?"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这句话不礼貌吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 205.515,
      "end": 212.395,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "句型本身很礼貌。但 Nigel 在她还没说完之前就插进来，context makes it pushy。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 212.745,
      "end": 215.738,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以语法 polite，不一定真的 comfortable？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 216.088,
      "end": 220.488,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. Polite words need respectful timing。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 220.838,
      "end": 224.299,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Elizabeth 说去看牙医，是不是一个好办法？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 224.649,
      "end": 231.209,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在故事里它制造了笑点；现实里，更好的办法是清楚又友好地说边界。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 231.558,
      "end": 233.095,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "比如怎么说？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 233.445,
      "end": 243.728,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可以说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I'm sorry, I need to go alone today"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。也可以说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I can't this morning"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，或者"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Maybe another time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 244.078,
      "end": 247.284,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这样既不羞辱对方，也不需要撒谎。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 247.634,
      "end": 252.714,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。真正的礼貌，不只是会问，也包括会尊重别人的 no。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 253.064,
      "end": 258.056,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I crossed the street to avoid meeting him, but he saw me and came running towards me."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 258.405,
      "end": 262.845,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It was no use pretending that I had not seen him, so I waved to him."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 263.195,
      "end": 266.099,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I never enjoy meeting Nigel Dykes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 266.449,
      "end": 269.065,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He never has anything to do."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 269.415,
      "end": 273.807,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "No matter how busy you are, he always insists on coming with you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 274.157,
      "end": 278.909,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I had to think of a way of preventing him from following me around all morning."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 279.259,
      "end": 284.179,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "'Hello, Nigel,' I said. 'Fancy meeting you here!'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 284.529,
      "end": 291.369,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "'Hi, Elizabeth,' Nigel answered. 'I was just wondering how to spend the morning -- until I saw you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 291.719,
      "end": 294.839,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "You're not busy doing anything, are you?'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 295.188,
      "end": 299.82,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "'No, not at all,' I answered. 'I'm going to...'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 300.17,
      "end": 304.85,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "'Would you mind my coming with you?' he asked, before I had finished speaking."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 305.2,
      "end": 308.848,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "'Not at all,' I lied, 'but I'm going to the dentist.'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 309.198,
      "end": 315.006,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "'Then I'll come with you,' he answered. 'There's always plenty to read in the waiting room!'"
        }
