      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "avoid"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文第一句就是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "to avoid meeting him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "start": 364.348,
      "end": 370.828,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "avoid"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意这里不是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "avoid to meet"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，而是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "avoid meeting"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 70,
      "start": 371.178,
      "end": 380.393,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "avoid"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你也可以说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "avoid interrupting"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，避免打断别人；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "avoid making noise"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，避免制造噪音。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 71,
      "start": 380.743,
      "end": 387.143,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "avoid"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在这个故事里，Elizabeth 不是讨厌所有人，只是想避免被 Nigel 缠上一上午。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 72,
      "start": 387.493,
      "end": 390.645,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
